    "error_code": "DELEGATION_SOURCE_TCT_REVOKED",
    "rationale": "B's snapshot fails signature verification and is discarded (RFC-AITP-0008 §1.5), so B's deny list is absent for chain[0]'s lookup. RFC-AITP-0011 §6 applies the configured revocation_policy.mode, here the schema default fail_closed: the hop counts as revoked, and a revoked hop invalidates the whole delegation. chain[0].jti is not in the snapshot's entries, so accepting the chain would mean the bad snapshot was ignored."
